on mouseUp me
  [  0] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [  2] thebuiltin 30 ........................... <the clickOn>
  [  4] setlocal 0 .............................. s = the clickOn
  [  6] getlocal 0 .............................. <s>
  [  8] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <s>
  [ 10] extcall 31 .............................. unclicked(s)
  [ 12] ret
end
